{
  "id": "JHN.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 1",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 51,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo omochakano ndiarengeo Ring’ana, ne Ring’ana nigo riarenge amo na Nyasae, na rirorio Ring’ana nigo riarenge Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyio agwo omochakano nigo arenge amo na Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goetera ase are ebinto bionsi bigakoreka; gento kende gionsi tigiakoregete otatiga goetera ase are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ime yaye nao bwarenge obogima; na obogima obwo nigo bwarenge oborabu ase mwanyabaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noro omobaso obarire ase omosunte, erio omosunte toyorimia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Narengeo omonto oyomo, otometwe korwa ase Nyasae, erieta riaye Yohana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo nigo achete abe kirori, erinde aorokie omobaso, bonsi banyare kwegena goetera asere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyio tarenge omobaso oria, korende nigo achete aorokie omobaso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omobaso bw’ekeene, oria okobarera kera omonto, ngocha orenge ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao arenge ase ense ime, ense egatongwa goetera asere, na abanto b’ense tibamomanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agaacha ase abaye, na barabwo abaare abaye tibamwancha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bonsi abamoitabete na kwegena erieta riaye, akabaa okobua babe abana ba Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo baiboirwe, tari korwa ase amanyinga a Mwanyabaanto, gose tari ase ogwancha kw’omobere, gose tari ase ogwancha kw’omonto, korende nigo baiboirwe na Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rirorio Ring’ana rigakoreka koba omobere, akamenya ase egati yaito. Tokarora obonene bwaye, obonene buna obw’Omwana omomoima oruure ase Tata, oichire nobuya na ekeene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana agakwana igoro yaye, agaaka egeturi, akabora, “Oyo nere nateebete igoro yaye ng’a: Oyorache magega yane nigo are omonene kombua, ekiagera nao arenge ritang’ani ase ’nde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ase oboikeranu bwaye intwe twensi twanyorire obuya igoro ase obuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki amachiiko arwerete ase amaboko a Musa, obuya na ekeene nigo biachete goetera ase Yeso Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde tari ororire Nyasae kero kende gionsi; Omwana omomoima ore ase egekuba gia Tata, nere omoorokirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oborori bwa Yohana Omobatisi igoro ya Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 3:1-12; Mar 1:7-8; Luk 3:15-17)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende obo nabwo oborori bwa Yohana, ekero Abayahudi batomete abakuani na Abalawi korwa Yerusalemu bamoboorie, “Aye naye ng’o?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akaorokia, takaana, agateeba, “Inche tari Kristo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamobooria, “Naki rende? Naye Elija?” Akaboora, “Inche tindi ere.” “Aye naye omobani oria?” Akairaneria, “Yaya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo bakamobooria, “Naye ng’o rende? Toe abatotomete okoiraneria. Naki ogweteeba?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabora, “Inche neriogi ri’oyo ogoaka egeturi ase erooro: Rongeyia enchera y’Omonene, buna omobani Isaya ateebete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na barabwo abatometwe nigo barwete ase Abafarisai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaboria Yohana, “Naki rende okobatisa, onye aye tori Kristo, gose Elija, gose omobani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana akabairaneria, “Inche nigo nkobatisa ase amaache, korende egati yaino nateneineo oyomotamanyeti inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere oyoraache magega yane, inche tinyisaini nyesibore enuga y’egekoroto kiaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nigo akoregete Bethania ng’umbu ya Yorodani, aase Yohana arenge kobatisera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emanwa y’eng’ondi ya Nyasae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere Yohana akarora Yeso ogocha asaare, akabora, “Rora, Emanwa y’Eng’ondi ya Nyasae, oyokorusia ebibe bi’ense!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo nere naare goteeba igoro yaye: Ngocha are omonto magega yane oyore omonene kombua, ekiagera nao arenge ritang’ani ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche tinamomanyete; korende aorokigwe ase Abaisraeli, nabo ase ayio ngacha na kobatisa ase amaache.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Yohana akaorokia, “Narorire Omoika ogoika korwa igoro buna riruma, okobeera igoro asare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche tinamomanya, korende ere oyontomete kobatisa ase amaache, oyio nere ontebetie: Ere oyo oranyare korora Omoika ogoika na goikaransa igoro yaye, oyio nere okobatisa n’Omoika Omochenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche narorire, naende naorokirie ng’a oyo nere Omwana o Nyasae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aborokigwa b’eritang’ani ba Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende rituko riare kobwatia Yohana nigo arenge oteneine amo na babere baborokigwa baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarigereria Yeso ogotaara, akabora, “Rora, Emanwa y’Eng’ondi ya Nyasae!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aborokigwa baria babere bakamoigwa ogoteeba aya, bagatunyana Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akeonchora, akabarora bakomotunyana, akababoria, “Ninki mokorigia?” Bakamoteebia, “Rabii” (okoonchorwa kwaye Omworokia), “nga’i omenyete?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Inchuo morore.” Bagaacha, bakarora aase amenyete, bakaba nere rituko riria; nigo chiarenge ang’e chinsa ikomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anderea, momura omwabo Simioni Petero, nigo arenge oyomo bwa baria babere baigwete Yohana, na gotunyana Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo akanyora ritang’ani Simioni momura omwabo omonyene, akamoteebia, “Twanyorire Masihi” (okoonchorwa kwaye Kristo).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamoira ase Yeso. Yeso akamorigereria, akabora, “Aye Simioni, omwana o Yohana, norokwe Kefa” (okoonchorwa kwaye Petero, gose rigena).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso Okorangeria Filipo na Natanaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko rikobwatia Yeso akarigia koimoka kogenda Galili. Akanyoora Filipo, akamoteebia, “Ntunyana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere Filipo nigo arenge omonto o Bethisaida, omochie bw’Anderea na Petero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Filipo akanyoora Natanaeli, akamoteebia, “Twanyorire ere oyo amang’ana aye arigetwe na Musa ase amachiiko, naende nababani, Yeso omwana o Yusufu, omonto o Nazareti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natanaeli akamobooria, “Egento ekiya nakenyare korwa Nazareti?” Filipo akamoteebia, “Inchuo orore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akarora Natanaeli ogocha asare, agakwana igoro yaye, “Rora oyo n’Omoisraeli ekeene, otari nobong’ainereria ime yaye!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natanaeli akamobooria, “Ing’ai kwamanyera?” Yeso akamoiraneria, “Ritang’ani Filipo atarakorangeria, ekero kwarenge inse ase omoko, konya nakororire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natanaeli akamoiraneria, “Omworokia, aye n’Omwana o Nyasae, naye Omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akamoiraneria, “Inee! Kwegenire ekiagera nagoteebia ng’a nakorooche inse ase omoko? Norore amang’ana amanene kobua aya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Ekeene, ekeene, nabateebirie: Inamorore igoro akoigoka, na abamalaika ba Nyasae bakoriina na goika igoro ase Omwana‐o‐Mwanyabaanto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
